WEBVTT

00:00:05.340 --> 00:00:06.550
I'll pass on a kimono.

00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:08.430
After all, they look
far better on Shino.

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:10.510
And I loathe boring church habits.

00:00:10.970 --> 00:00:12.560
Oh, but I love black.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:15.740
Make sure my ribbons match the dress.
Nothing cheap, mind you.

00:00:16.020 --> 00:00:18.740
Bring me black shoes.
The heels are to be 7cm high.

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:21.860
I will not tolerate
anything higher nor lower.

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:26.250
As for my tea, I will take a blend
of rosehip and lemongrass.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:29.030
Cover the scones with
plenty of sour cream.

00:00:29.030 --> 00:00:31.450
I would also like some
uncured ham and cheese.

00:00:31.830 --> 00:00:32.550
You truly...

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:36.010
...aren't the least bit cute, are you?

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:39.480
What right have you to
complain after kidnapping me

00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:41.360
and confining me to such a place?

00:00:41.360 --> 00:00:42.640
Well, fox freak?

00:00:42.880 --> 00:00:47.650
In order to invite those two here,
your presence was necessary.

00:00:48.090 --> 00:00:51.260
To be honest, I had heard
that the lady survivor

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.880
from Otsuka Village was
incredibly beautiful,

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:56.160
but I see that these
rumors were unfounded.

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:58.410
Really? But they are true.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.410
You see, they refer to Brother Shino.

00:01:02.050 --> 00:01:04.050
He genuinely looked just like a doll.

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:08.710
He was so pretty that I couldn't begin
to compete with him...

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:13.660
An older brother who looks like a doll?

00:01:13.660 --> 00:01:16.630
It was customary for
boys to dress as girls

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:19.440
until they turn 15 to
help them grow strong.

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:25.020
Oh, I did a little research
and found that you were adopted.

00:01:25.590 --> 00:01:27.000
Are you jealous?

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.520
Jealous of how he was
raised with such love?

00:01:34.450 --> 00:01:35.530
Hardly.

00:01:35.990 --> 00:01:40.920
Shino and Sosuke have loved me
tenderly ever since I was little.

00:01:40.920 --> 00:01:44.450
I never had any dealings
with fox freaks like you!

00:01:48.260 --> 00:01:50.910
Oh, would you like another cup of tea?

00:01:50.910 --> 00:01:51.810
I certainly would.

00:03:25.750 --> 00:03:30.170
Humans and Demons

00:03:32.210 --> 00:03:33.600
So this is the Imperial Capital?

00:03:33.980 --> 00:03:36.650
Dang, it's super crowded!

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.650
Would you be Shino Inuzuka
and Sosuke Inukawa?

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:43.530
Under orders from the
Church's headquarters,

00:03:43.530 --> 00:03:45.390
we have come to receive you.

00:03:45.390 --> 00:03:47.660
The Elders are eagerly
waiting to meet you.

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.610
I am sorry, but we
brought luggage with us.

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:53.670
May we stop by our lodging first?

00:03:53.860 --> 00:03:55.360
That is not necessary.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:57.070
We have already made
arrangements for you.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.170
Still, I must wonder,

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:02.050
is this child indeed the one?

00:04:02.540 --> 00:04:03.930
You jerk!

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:05.550
Shino Inuzuka!

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:12.230
You took your time.
I had grown weary of waiting.

00:04:14.260 --> 00:04:15.380
Master Satomi!

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:16.690
What brings you here?

00:04:17.720 --> 00:04:19.840
I merely came to pick these two up.

00:04:20.430 --> 00:04:24.200
Isn't it my job to tend to the survivors
from Otsuka Village?

00:04:24.310 --> 00:04:26.650
Yes, but the Elders...!

00:04:26.650 --> 00:04:29.180
I shall look after them
as their guardian.

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:31.690
Who is that?

00:04:32.360 --> 00:04:33.180
Rio.

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.370
Shino, do you know him?

00:04:38.120 --> 00:04:41.050
He is Rio Satomi, a member of
the Four Houses of the Sacred Beasts.

00:04:45.590 --> 00:04:48.970
Central

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.970
Kenro Hotel

00:04:51.060 --> 00:04:51.830
What?

00:04:52.590 --> 00:04:55.770
Didn't you hear me? I am busy.

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:56.980
We shall talk tomorrow.

00:04:57.290 --> 00:05:01.220
Oh, you needn't worry about
your longtime friend.

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:02.640
I will let you see her tomorrow.

00:05:02.640 --> 00:05:03.230
Excuse me.

00:05:03.770 --> 00:05:05.430
Huh? Hey!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:08.750
Yikes! You'd think the world
revolved around him!

00:05:09.810 --> 00:05:12.160
At any rate, it looks like
he dropped us off at a hotel.

00:05:12.160 --> 00:05:13.530
I'll go sign in.

00:05:14.190 --> 00:05:16.870
By the way, how do you
know Mr. Satomi...?

00:05:18.100 --> 00:05:19.780
I'm gonna take a look around the area.

00:05:19.780 --> 00:05:22.000
Shino, make sure you don't wander far!

00:05:22.370 --> 00:05:23.660
I know!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:00.180
Hey, did you hear?

00:06:00.180 --> 00:06:02.330
They say that a demon
appears around Suzaku Gate.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:03.210
A demon?

00:06:03.280 --> 00:06:06.830
How terrifying! Does it attack people?

00:06:06.830 --> 00:06:10.470
No, it doesn't attack humans.
It goes after monsters.

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:12.620
Supposedly it devours
spirits and ghouls.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:14.010
A demon...

00:06:14.840 --> 00:06:17.350
Demons are humans; humans are demons.

00:06:23.220 --> 00:06:27.440
Demons are made by humans.
They are made by the hearts of man.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:29.390
What's that supposed to mean?

00:06:33.560 --> 00:06:36.280
Blah! Crowds make me tipsy.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.440
Aw, man!

00:06:37.850 --> 00:06:40.570
I guess we better head on back, huh?

00:06:40.570 --> 00:06:42.570
Murasame, go get Sosuke for me.

00:06:42.570 --> 00:06:43.470
Roger!

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:54.720
Learn when to give up!

00:06:55.000 --> 00:06:57.730
If I said I don't know him, then I don't!
Now be off with you.

00:06:58.010 --> 00:06:59.720
Ya damn monk!

00:06:59.720 --> 00:07:02.900
I know good and well
that Genpachi is being held here!

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:04.360
Give my bro back!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.270
What nonsense is this?

00:07:06.770 --> 00:07:10.610
We did not apprehend
a human, but a demon.

00:07:10.890 --> 00:07:12.140
You what?!

00:07:12.140 --> 00:07:13.350
Kobungo!

00:07:14.440 --> 00:07:16.370
Geh! Pa...

00:07:16.530 --> 00:07:19.010
You are simply asking
for divine punishment!

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.390
I offer my humblest
apologies for the trouble

00:07:25.390 --> 00:07:27.630
my foolish son has caused
you, Father Seiran.

00:07:27.790 --> 00:07:29.320
He truly is a nuisance.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.490
We will not tolerate further interfere
with our work here.

00:07:32.980 --> 00:07:35.270
Please make sure to strongly
discourage him from returning.

00:07:37.460 --> 00:07:39.960
Suzaku Gate

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:43.680
Pa!

00:07:43.680 --> 00:07:45.080
Are you a moron, my boy?

00:07:45.080 --> 00:07:47.310
Making a scene now will get you nowhere.

00:07:47.310 --> 00:07:49.140
Can't you use your head some?

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:52.360
You are stepping in something.

00:07:55.230 --> 00:07:56.650
Aw, crap!

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:01.780
Hey, you okay?

00:08:01.780 --> 00:08:05.370
Heavens! You just go from
one thing to the next.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:06.960
I feel bad about it!

00:08:07.570 --> 00:08:11.470
Oh, isn't he a church rat?
This is gonna be such a pain!

00:08:11.870 --> 00:08:13.340
Maybe I should leave him
with the military police...

00:08:17.860 --> 00:08:19.110
What a coincidence.

00:08:20.130 --> 00:08:21.860
What the heck are you?

00:08:26.760 --> 00:08:29.050
Ma'am, seconds on the yakitori!

00:08:29.430 --> 00:08:32.020
I'll take your rice omelet set, too!

00:08:32.020 --> 00:08:34.200
For dessert, I'll have
your green tea parfait special.

00:08:35.500 --> 00:08:38.240
I picked up a brat who obviously
hasn't been fed in ages...

00:08:38.990 --> 00:08:41.980
Hey, Kiddo. Didn't you
say your name is Shino?

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:45.000
Are you here sightseeing?
What's the name of your inn?

00:08:45.290 --> 00:08:47.740
I don't remember. But I'll be just fine.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:48.990
I've sent for someone to pick me up.

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:49.750
Pick you up...?

00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.130
See?

00:08:59.510 --> 00:09:01.590
A crow and doggy came to pick you up?!

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:03.480
Thanks for the feast!

00:09:05.590 --> 00:09:08.050
Hey, Shino! Not so fast.

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:17.190
That starved brat is far
scarier than any demon...

00:09:19.810 --> 00:09:22.230
I believe I told you not to wander far.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:24.340
See, my feet just carried me away.

00:09:25.280 --> 00:09:27.860
By the way, who was that man back there?

00:09:27.860 --> 00:09:29.040
Dunno.

00:09:29.590 --> 00:09:31.970
He came outta nowhere
and turned me into his rug.

00:09:32.570 --> 00:09:35.050
To show that he was sorry,
he treated me to a meal.

00:09:35.700 --> 00:09:38.300
He was fighting over a demon
or something like that.

00:09:38.420 --> 00:09:39.170
A demon?

00:09:42.290 --> 00:09:46.190
I heard an uproar coming
from the front gate earlier today.

00:09:46.550 --> 00:09:48.510
Did you run into some trouble?

00:09:48.510 --> 00:09:50.670
A stray mutt had managed
to weasel his way in.

00:09:51.140 --> 00:09:53.690
I am terribly sorry for
the unseemly disturbance.

00:09:53.970 --> 00:09:55.920
From what I have heard, Seiran,

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:59.950
the demon you caught is
said to devour spirits.

00:10:01.770 --> 00:10:03.950
'Tis true, Abbot Myoko.

00:10:04.150 --> 00:10:06.570
In which case, we could
set it loose in the city-

00:10:06.570 --> 00:10:10.970
No, if he devours the spirits,
then their numbers will decrease.

00:10:11.620 --> 00:10:13.710
Humans are the only thing that could

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.470
possibly fill those dwindling numbers.

00:10:16.370 --> 00:10:19.090
Demons have no comprehension
or right or wrong.

00:10:19.710 --> 00:10:21.180
All they do is eat.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:27.300
That is merely a demon and eventually,
it will eat humans.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:52.280
So?

00:10:53.200 --> 00:10:55.990
It's still early. Please
get some more rest.

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:57.590
I'm going out for a quick walk.

00:10:58.830 --> 00:10:59.710
'Kay!

00:11:18.560 --> 00:11:18.990
Wha-?!

00:11:24.180 --> 00:11:25.370
He's huge!

00:11:28.320 --> 00:11:29.620
Do not brashly touch him.

00:11:29.920 --> 00:11:32.360
Unlike your dog, he is not
of a gentle disposition.

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:34.960
For real? That's no fun.

00:11:36.990 --> 00:11:39.330
It's been five years, hasn't it, Satomi?

00:11:40.080 --> 00:11:41.410
So you remember who I am?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:44.140
But it would seem that
Sosuke has forgotten.

00:11:44.450 --> 00:11:47.380
He hardly remembers
anything from back then.

00:11:47.960 --> 00:11:48.870
Is that right?

00:11:52.090 --> 00:11:54.770
I must say, I never expected this to be

00:11:54.770 --> 00:11:57.150
the price you would pay for Murasame.

00:11:58.350 --> 00:11:59.270
What price?

00:12:00.260 --> 00:12:03.060
I was referring to how you
are still a child, unable to age...

00:12:08.480 --> 00:12:12.740
In regard to Murasame, as of yet,
none know of its true nature.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:14.670
It is a demon sword shrouded in mystery.

00:12:15.170 --> 00:12:17.000
There are some who believe it is a god,

00:12:17.430 --> 00:12:19.190
while others claim it is a spirit.

00:12:19.700 --> 00:12:22.190
Others still say that it is either cursed
or the embodiment of disaster.

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:24.890
It can slash through creatures of evil,

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:27.210
force spirits to grovel before it,

00:12:27.210 --> 00:12:28.660
and bend any that roam the Earth

00:12:28.660 --> 00:12:30.210
without physical form
to obey its bidding.

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:35.100
But in exchange for its powers,

00:12:35.100 --> 00:12:38.030
whosoever wields Murasame
must pay a hefty price.

00:12:38.680 --> 00:12:42.040
For you, it is probably the way
your body has ceased aging...

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.140
Its wielders ultimately
suffer horrific deaths

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.450
rather than dying of old age.

00:12:50.770 --> 00:12:54.140
In the end, this only
proves how audacious it is

00:12:54.140 --> 00:12:55.960
for a human to keep a god in his body.

00:12:58.120 --> 00:12:59.960
Did you think I was long dead?

00:13:01.080 --> 00:13:02.310
Sorry to let ya down.

00:13:04.990 --> 00:13:07.470
As you can see, I'm doing just great.

00:13:07.850 --> 00:13:09.450
That's true for both Murasame and me!

00:13:19.470 --> 00:13:22.590
So? Why'd you come to
receive me, going so far

00:13:22.590 --> 00:13:24.700
as to push those church
dudes out of your way?

00:13:26.440 --> 00:13:28.900
Is it payback time for what you
did way back when?

00:13:34.150 --> 00:13:35.300
Good morning.

00:13:35.790 --> 00:13:38.630
Are we enacting a scene from a
ghost story bright and early?

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.430
This could even surprise
the Imperial Capital's journalists.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:48.390
Your childhood friend is in
the Four Houses' manor.

00:13:49.370 --> 00:13:51.290
We will head over as soon as
you finish your meal.

00:13:52.340 --> 00:13:54.630
Shino, where are your manners?

00:13:54.630 --> 00:13:56.140
You shouldn't be in your nightwear.

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:59.220
It's cool. It's not
like anyone's looking.

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.930
But Mr. Satomi is here.

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:02.900
I don't see anyone!

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:04.400
You are such a child.

00:14:04.400 --> 00:14:05.850
Don't call me a child!

00:14:05.850 --> 00:14:07.200
I see that Murasame's curse affected

00:14:07.200 --> 00:14:08.970
more than just your appearance.

00:14:10.010 --> 00:14:11.650
What the hell?!

00:14:11.650 --> 00:14:13.520
Your screwed up personality
hasn't changed the-

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:17.790
I am sorry. I will be
sure to reeducate him.

00:14:28.180 --> 00:14:28.890
What is it?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.310
He's only nice and friendly with Sosuke!
That's so not fair!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.090
So, you jerk!

00:14:36.610 --> 00:14:37.930
What was that about?

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:40.220
He truly is a child.

00:14:40.810 --> 00:14:43.320
By the way, earlier
you and Shino were...

00:14:46.850 --> 00:14:48.920
No, forget it.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:51.320
KONA-YA

00:14:51.520 --> 00:14:54.230
Damn it! Curse that monk.

00:14:54.230 --> 00:14:57.200
It's already been a full week since
Genpachi went missing.

00:14:59.030 --> 00:15:01.350
What should I do, Sis?

00:15:03.350 --> 00:15:04.240
Pa...

00:15:06.840 --> 00:15:09.710
I am certain Nui must be
terribly worried about him.

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:13.580
The dear cared deeply for Genpachi.

00:15:14.420 --> 00:15:15.480
If Sis were still here,

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:18.230
there is no way she would
stand by and let this happen!

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.880
I understand your anxiety,

00:15:21.880 --> 00:15:24.450
but you need to bide your time
when it comes to the Shogetsu Institute.

00:15:25.220 --> 00:15:29.190
They are not the sort to listen to reason
if you openly confront them.

00:15:29.790 --> 00:15:32.110
I shall do some asking around myself.

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.470
Okay...

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:41.790
You wouldn't die this easily,
would you, Genpachi?

00:15:43.950 --> 00:15:47.140
And here we both managed
to come back home

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.170
from the Northern battlefront alive...

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.550
Come to think of it,

00:16:05.550 --> 00:16:08.780
you guys are the only ones I've seen
in this manor despite how huge it is.

00:16:09.310 --> 00:16:13.270
Are you and the foxes the only members
of the Osaki family here?

00:16:13.270 --> 00:16:14.270
Yes, indeed.

00:16:14.270 --> 00:16:17.140
Children such as myself
who harbor a Sacred Beast

00:16:17.140 --> 00:16:19.880
are fully alienated by
their entire family.

00:16:21.580 --> 00:16:24.460
But I have a father and several siblings
in the outside world.

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:26.800
Not that I have many
opportunities to see them...

00:16:27.830 --> 00:16:31.300
I see... Don't you get lonely?

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:37.580
What should I do?

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:38.450
In regard to?

00:16:39.420 --> 00:16:41.730
When you say things
like that, it makes me

00:16:41.730 --> 00:16:44.560
want to keep you here all the more.

00:16:47.720 --> 00:16:49.760
Hamaji!

00:16:58.160 --> 00:16:59.870
This is the Four Houses' manor.

00:17:01.440 --> 00:17:02.840
Shino! Sosuke!

00:17:06.300 --> 00:17:07.540
You're late!

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.010
What in the world have
you two been doing this whole time?

00:17:10.570 --> 00:17:12.590
Huh? Er, sorry...

00:17:15.540 --> 00:17:18.450
H-Hamaji? Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:17:18.960 --> 00:17:21.380
Or did they do something mean to you?

00:17:21.960 --> 00:17:23.350
Damn those foxes!

00:17:23.800 --> 00:17:27.200
Nuh-uh, the foxes aren't at fault.

00:17:27.680 --> 00:17:32.350
They bought me new clothes
and shoes when I needed them.

00:17:32.350 --> 00:17:34.040
I was fed three meals a
day and got to take naps,

00:17:34.040 --> 00:17:35.360
so I had a pretty good time.

00:17:36.390 --> 00:17:38.010
When I think about how
this celebrity-treatment

00:17:38.010 --> 00:17:39.880
is about to come to an end...

00:17:40.730 --> 00:17:43.660
If you like, you are welcome
to stay here forever.

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.620
I am Kaname Osaki. It's a pleasure.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:49.630
Was it you?! Are you the one
who kidnapped Hamaji?

00:17:49.810 --> 00:17:52.600
I didn't kidnap her. I invited her over.

00:17:53.160 --> 00:17:55.580
Welcome to the Four Houses' manor.

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:59.140
Well, come on in. I have
a feast laid out for you.

00:17:59.330 --> 00:18:00.280
A feast?

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:02.890
It isn't a feast of
deep-fried bean curd, is it?

00:18:04.130 --> 00:18:06.390
He said that he would give us a tour
of the city this afternoon.

00:18:06.670 --> 00:18:09.090
Have you tried the capital's
renowned beef liver ice cream?

00:18:09.090 --> 00:18:10.840
I HATE liver!

00:18:11.000 --> 00:18:13.300
It's a mix of liver and ice cream?

00:18:13.910 --> 00:18:15.400
It is surprisingly delicious.

00:18:16.680 --> 00:18:18.000
I am Rio Satomi.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:21.160
I apologize for Osaki's
inappropriate behavior.

00:18:21.480 --> 00:18:22.390
Satomi...?

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:24.530
I reside here as well.

00:18:24.880 --> 00:18:27.410
So you're also a member
of the Four Houses?

00:18:27.560 --> 00:18:28.320
Yeah...

00:18:32.660 --> 00:18:35.230
He is pretty, but I get the feeling

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.560
that I have seen him somewhere before.

00:18:43.420 --> 00:18:47.430
That outfit! You look just
like an heir to new money.

00:18:48.970 --> 00:18:51.190
Yep, the same goes for you as well.

00:18:54.010 --> 00:18:56.170
Well then, I expect you
to fully entertain me

00:18:56.170 --> 00:18:57.930
in compensation for locking me up!

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.200
Please show me mercy.

00:18:59.890 --> 00:19:02.190
How cute! I wonder which
I would look best in.

00:19:02.190 --> 00:19:03.700
I think you would look
good in either one.

00:19:04.150 --> 00:19:06.070
"A tour," my foot.

00:19:06.070 --> 00:19:08.260
This is more like he's
taking her out on a date!

00:19:08.260 --> 00:19:11.200
Shino, make sure you don't
eat too much and upset your stomach.

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:12.450
I know!

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.090
By the way, Shino,

00:19:15.610 --> 00:19:18.000
I've been wanting
to ask you this since yesterday,

00:19:18.000 --> 00:19:20.340
but what is your relationship
with Mr. Satomi?

00:19:20.500 --> 00:19:24.220
Huh? Er, well, it's nothing special...

00:19:24.220 --> 00:19:25.970
Nothing special?

00:19:35.010 --> 00:19:39.640
Honestly! Things keep
getting in the way today.

00:19:50.530 --> 00:19:51.650
What's going on?

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.200
Is he a dog trainer?

00:19:53.200 --> 00:19:55.480
Not my darling Sally!

00:19:57.780 --> 00:20:00.120
It's no fair how they all go to you, So.

00:20:00.120 --> 00:20:02.270
Sosuke certainly is popular.

00:20:02.830 --> 00:20:06.460
Sosuke has always been
popular with the animals.

00:20:09.800 --> 00:20:10.840
Yuck!

00:20:12.380 --> 00:20:13.300
What were you doing in there?!

00:20:13.300 --> 00:20:13.970
It smells...
What were you doing in there?!

00:20:13.970 --> 00:20:14.650
It smells...
Nasty!

00:20:14.890 --> 00:20:17.900
I smell... I smell the
scent of a spirit.

00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:20.890
It mingles amongst us,
pretending to be human.

00:20:26.870 --> 00:20:28.410
Is something the matter?

00:20:29.630 --> 00:20:31.780
No, it's nothing...

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:53.840
Without a doubt, the Imperial Capital
is filled with peril...

00:21:01.930 --> 00:21:04.010
You have gone a week
without eating or drinking.

00:21:06.900 --> 00:21:09.890
I should have expected as much from
a demon that eats spirits,

00:21:09.890 --> 00:21:11.830
Genpachi Inukai.

00:21:13.990 --> 00:21:15.220
It is absurd for creatures such as you,

00:21:15.220 --> 00:21:17.300
with one foot on the other side,

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:21.290
to try and live amongst humans.

00:21:21.790 --> 00:21:23.590
Show me your true form
without further ado!

00:21:25.560 --> 00:21:27.340
I hate how you are taking
things out on me.

00:21:28.550 --> 00:21:30.620
Who do I resemble in your mind's eye?

00:21:32.210 --> 00:21:34.790
Do you hate the way your younger brother

00:21:34.790 --> 00:21:36.990
was chased out of the house, Seiran?

00:21:45.640 --> 00:21:46.660
Get him!

00:23:25.960 --> 00:23:40.980
The Approaching Demon

00:23:27.370 --> 00:23:30.120
Yikes! Hamaji, what is with this
rancid stench and all that smoke?

00:23:30.120 --> 00:23:32.040
I made an herbal tea
that is good for colds.

00:23:32.040 --> 00:23:34.380
It includes Ginseng,
pen shells, ambergris,

00:23:34.380 --> 00:23:36.300
fly amanita, hyoscyamus and cantharis.

00:23:36.300 --> 00:23:38.710
Hold it! Aren't those
last three poisonous?

00:23:38.710 --> 00:23:40.470
Fight poison with poison!
